      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cat 4 Setup — Idempotent (safe to re-run)\n\n**What it does (in order):**\n1. Lists every event on calendar (±1 year range), deletes each.\n2. Lists all Gmail drafts; for each, fetches headers; if subject contains `TEST_MS-SDA`, deletes the draft.\n3. Tries to create the `category4_results` tab (skipped silently if it already exists).\n4. Clears all data in `category4_results` (wholeSheet).\n5. Re-appends the header row.\n\n**Result after running:** clean calendar, no TEST_ drafts, results tab has header only.\n\n**Run before:** Cat4 SDA Test Runner full 60-test batch.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 720
      },
